  "instructions": [
    "In a blender, combine apple juice, nuka-pickle, dash spicy sauce, and panch phrase spice blend. Blend until smooth.",
    "Pour the mixture into a saucepan and heat over medium heat until warm.",
    "Remove from heat and stir in salt and black pepper.",
    "Pour the mixture into a piping bag and pipe into a pandan leaf wrap.",
    "Top with sour cream and chopped cilantro (if using).",
    "Serve immediately.",
    "Note: this recipe is for refrigerator pickling/preserving only — store in the refrigerator and consume within 1 week. Do not water-bath can without an acid (vinegar or lemon juice)."
